{"title":"Legend of Northern Blade","synopsis":"Ketika dunia diliputi kegelapan oleh Malam Sunyi\nSeniman Bela Diri dari seluruh tempat berkumpul untuk membentuk Sekte Surgawi Utara\nDengan kekuatan luar biasa dari Sekte Surgawi Utara Silent Night didesak mundur jauh dan orangorang mulai menikmati kedamaian sekali lagi\nNamun seiring berjalannya waktu para seniman bela diri dari daratan mulai berkonspirasi melawan Sekte Surgawi Utara\ndan akhirnya menyebabkan kematian Pemimpin Sekte Generasi Keempat Jin KwanHo\nKetika semua orang meninggalkan sekte putra satusatunya Jin KwanHo Jin MuWon tertinggal\nMuWon tidak pernah belajar apapun tentang seni bela diri tetapi ia akhirnya menemukan Teknik Martial diamdiam ditinggalkan oleh ayahnya dan mulai memperoleh seni bela diri dari Sekte Surgawi Utara Lalu suatu hari seorang gadis misterius muncul di hadapan MuWon","alternative_title":"The Legend Of Northern Blade","author":"Woo-Gak","artist":"Hae-Min","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Martial Arts"],"chapters":[{"id":"a59c8b37-1491-4a82-a23d-fa19e90ef417","number":"202","title":"Chapter 202","date":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"id":"c305c225-3b6d-4fa5-af9a-c55774b9a8c1","number":"201","title":"Chapter 201","date":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"id":"3fb315a9-bfca-4760-a27e-41d63346de5d","number":"200","title":"Chapter 200","date":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"id":"70ff55d7-e385-4d46-b7f4-98a357abed03","number":"199","title":"Chapter 199","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"19484474-f4a5-4bf4-810d-d8601abb1ca4","number":"198","title":"Chapter 198","date":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"id":"3a4d8870-297b-4c07-8b12-1c12e5f21441","number":"197","title":"Chapter 197","date":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"id":"a23d3529-f4aa-46a0-8d00-0035e7fccca1","number":"196","title":"Chapter 196","date":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"id":"8854e649-1789-4b43-bd35-30d014b39956","number":"195","title":"Chapter 195","date":"2024-12-01","images":[]},{"id":"be7d0e8b-36cd-4f07-8231-6c26add57ebb","